# Privacy Policy: Aniimo Companion

_Last updated: 2026-10-02_

Aniimo Companion ("the app") is developed by Xerxz. This policy explains what data the app handles.

## Data stored on your device
Your caught list, saved teams and egg timers are stored only on your device. They are not sent to us. Uninstalling the app deletes them. Android's backup may include them if you have device backup turned on.

## Advertising
The free version shows ads served by Google AdMob. AdMob may collect and process device identifiers (such as the advertising ID), approximate location derived from IP address, and ad interaction data to serve and measure ads. In the EEA, UK and Switzerland the app asks for your consent through Google's User Messaging Platform before personalised ads are shown, and you can change your choice anytime under Settings > Ad privacy options. See https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads.

## Purchases
Premium purchases and subscriptions are processed by Google Play. We never see your payment details. The app only receives confirmation of what you have purchased so it can unlock Premium.

## Children
The app is not directed to children under 13.

